// A declared pack must be imported — but only when this repo actually HOLDS
// prose for it, which is the same condition the generator skips on. A pack
// whose files are not vendored yet has no rules to load by any route (a stale
// mount, which the engine's own unknown-pack error reports), and demanding an
// import for it would make this rule contradict the file it is checking.
